  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-08T01:17:05.603Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently the languages added in your profile are represented as 3 letter abbreviations (e.g. \"CES\") with a translated full name on hover (e.g. \"Čeština\").\nBut it might be not that obvious for everyone which language e.g. \"CES\" and \"Čeština\" stands for. \nPlease add a full english name on hover - e.g. \"Czech (Čeština)\" - and/or a flag in the Languages sections.",
